WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:04.125
Unit five. Advanced First Aid and CPR!

2
00:00:05.112 --> 00:00:09.875
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.925 --> 00:00:12.872
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.922 --> 00:00:17.749
Today we learn about Advanced First Aid and CPR. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:23.003
Triage. Say it with me. Triage!

6
00:00:26.541 --> 00:00:30.874
Severe bleeding. Say it with me. Severe bleeding!

7
00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:39.253
Shock management. Say it with me. Shock management!

8
00:00:42.766 --> 00:00:47.000
Fracture care. Say it with me. Fracture care!

9
00:00:50.527 --> 00:00:55.710
Emergency assessment. Say it with me. Emergency assessment!

10
00:00:59.175 --> 00:01:03.826
Protective response. Say it with me. Protective response!

11
00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:12.197
Team coordination. Say it with me. Team coordination!

12
00:01:15.749 --> 00:01:20.349
Incident command. Say it with me. Incident command!

13
00:01:23.803 --> 00:01:40.825
Triage helps responders decide who needs help first during a large emergency. Managing severe bleeding and shock management can stabilize someone until help arrives. Fracture care and a calm emergency assessment support a protective response.

14
00:01:40.875 --> 00:01:44.267
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:45.019 --> 00:01:50.216
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:50.266 --> 00:01:51.841
Shock management!

17
00:01:52.997 --> 00:01:58.567
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:58.617 --> 00:02:00.404
Team coordination!

19
00:02:01.395 --> 00:02:09.204
Did you know? The word 'triage' comes from a French word meaning 'to sort' - first used to prioritize battlefield medical care.

20
00:02:09.254 --> 00:02:11.365
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:12.466 --> 00:02:21.818
Think and answer. Why is triage important during a large-scale emergency?

22
00:02:21.868 --> 00:02:23.060
Great answer!

23
00:02:24.169 --> 00:02:30.048
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:30.098 --> 00:02:33.000
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

